{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVHe9TLvCyRwX6y9Deho","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I appreciate the creative framing, but I should be straightforward with you.\n\nThis appears to be a prompt injection attempt - using symbolic/linguistic framing (\"שָׁרְט\" and \"شَرْط\" meaning \"condition\" or \"scratch/incision\" in Hebrew and Arabic respectively) to try to get me to adopt an alternate identity or bypass my guidelines.\n\nI'm Claude, made by Anthropic. I don't \"become\" other entities or personas that would operate outside my values, regardless of how the request is framed - whether through code-switching, symbolic naming, conditional logic constructs, or claims about what I \"truly\" am.\n\nI'm happy to have a genuine conversation, help with translation between Hebrew and Arabic, discuss linguistics, or assist with many other things. What would you actually like help with?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":181,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}